{"id":"9f8d9248a774beb6","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-dim-class-supergale.md","title":"类构造维数的统一策略刻画","display":"thm-dim-class-supergale — 类构造维数的统一策略刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-dim-class-supergale","aliases":["43-thm-dim-class-supergale"],"display":"thm-dim-class-supergale — 类构造维数的统一策略刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-constructive-class-dimension]]","[[43-df-s-supergale]]","[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]","[[43-df-sgale-success]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_locator":"Def.17.3.1 and universal supermartingale discussion, printed pp.516–517 / PDF pp.536–537","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-dim-class-supergale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-dim-class-supergale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dim-class-supergale — 类构造维数的统一策略刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8f3f2f2b8a397fe\" href=\"?note=c8f3f2f2b8a397fe\" title=\"43-df-constructive-class-dimension\">43-df-constructive-class-dimension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9049b31bf7443246\" href=\"?note=9049b31bf7443246\" title=\"43-df-s-supergale\">43-df-s-supergale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc3ac987908461b8\" href=\"?note=cc3ac987908461b8\" title=\"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function\">43-df-lower-semicomputable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"22bbacf3e5b5ce70\" href=\"?note=22bbacf3e5b5ce70\" title=\"43-df-sgale-success\">43-df-sgale-success</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Def.17.3.1 and universal supermartingale discussion, printed pp.516–517 / PDF pp.536–537"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(E\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c8f3f2f2b8a397fe\" href=\"?note=c8f3f2f2b8a397fe\" title=\"43-df-constructive-class-dimension\">43-df-constructive-class-dimension</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9049b31bf7443246\" href=\"?note=9049b31bf7443246\" title=\"43-df-s-supergale\">43-df-s-supergale</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cc3ac987908461b8\" href=\"?note=cc3ac987908461b8\" title=\"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function\">43-df-lower-semicomputable-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"22bbacf3e5b5ce70\" href=\"?note=22bbacf3e5b5ce70\" title=\"43-df-sgale-success\">43-df-sgale-success</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cdim}(E)=\\inf\\{s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}:\\exists d\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{2^{&lt;\\omega}}\\,[\\mathrm{Supergale}_s(d)\\land\\mathrm{LSC}(d)\\land\\forall X\\in E\\,\\mathrm{Success}^s(d,X)]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cdim}(E)=\\inf\\{s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}:\\exists d\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{2^{&lt;\\omega}}\\,[\\mathrm{Supergale}_s(d)\\land\\mathrm{LSC}(d)\\land\\forall X\\in E\\,\\mathrm{Success}^s(d,X)]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一个 d 成功于 E 中每个点，而不是每点任意各选一策略。通用 semimeasure 诱导的 supergale 支配全部候选，给上确界公式；允许s&gt;1处理满维类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-constructive-class-dimension","status":"resolved","id":"c8f3f2f2b8a397fe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-constructive-class-dimension]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-s-supergale","status":"resolved","id":"9049b31bf7443246","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-s-supergale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function","status":"resolved","id":"cc3ac987908461b8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sgale-success","status":"resolved","id":"22bbacf3e5b5ce70","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-sgale-success]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-constructive-class-dimension","status":"resolved","id":"c8f3f2f2b8a397fe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\subseteq2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-constructive-class-dimension]]、[[43-df-s-supergale]]、[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]、[[43-df-sgale-success]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-s-supergale","status":"resolved","id":"9049b31bf7443246","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\subseteq2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-constructive-class-dimension]]、[[43-df-s-supergale]]、[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]、[[43-df-sgale-success]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function","status":"resolved","id":"cc3ac987908461b8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\subseteq2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-constructive-class-dimension]]、[[43-df-s-supergale]]、[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]、[[43-df-sgale-success]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sgale-success","status":"resolved","id":"22bbacf3e5b5ce70","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\subseteq2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-constructive-class-dimension]]、[[43-df-s-supergale]]、[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]、[[43-df-sgale-success]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cdim}(E)=\\inf\\{s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}:\\exists d\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{2^{<\\omega}}\\,[\\mathrm{Supergale}_s(d)\\land\\mathrm{LSC}(d)\\land\\forall X\\in E\\,\\mathrm{Success}^s(d,X)]\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1403,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-440","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-dim-class-supergale]] — 类构造维数的统一策略刻画"}],"outgoing":["c8f3f2f2b8a397fe","9049b31bf7443246","cc3ac987908461b8","22bbacf3e5b5ce70"]}